<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>We have found that Christ the Spirit is</l><l>Who within our spirit dwells;</l><l>How available, how near He is,</l><l>And His sweetness all excels.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>We have found the way to live by Christ—</l><l>Pray His Word and call His name!</l><l>This—the eating, drinking—has sufficed</l><l>And its worth we now proclaim.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>We have found the local church, our home;</l><l>We are home and home indeed!</l><l>Nevermore in Babylon we roam;</l><l>In the church is all we need.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>We have found that meeting with the saints</l><l>Is the greatest joy on earth;</l><l>’Tis by this our spirit never faints</l><l>And our lives are filled with worth.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
